#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:25
msgid ""
"下表列出解析器接受的能力格式；可选能力必须由具体芯片事实证明，不能从 CPU "
"名称推断存在或已启用。`none`/零明确表示未声明该能力，不做运行时发现。"
msgstr ""
"The table lists capability formats accepted by the parser. Optional "
"capabilities require concrete chip facts, not inference from CPU names. "
"`none`/zero explicitly means undeclared, with no runtime discovery."

