#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:40
msgid ""
"Cortex-M 使用 short-enums ABI。无 FPU、无 MVE 时使用 soft；有 FPU 时明确选择 hard 或 "
"softfp。M55/M85 的 MVE 为 `none`、`integer` 或 `float`：无 MVE 添加 `+nomve`，无 scalar"
" FP 添加 `+nofp`；integer-only MVE 使用 softfp，FPU 事实 仍为 `none`。FP-MVE 必须同时声明可用 "
"FPU。M55/M85 的 FPU 选择为 `auto`、 `fpv5-sp-d16` 或 `fpv5-d16`，`auto` "
"是显式编译器选项，不是硬件自动探测。"
msgstr ""
"Cortex-M uses short-enums ABI. Without FPU/MVE use soft; with FPU explicitly"
" choose hard/softfp. M55/M85 MVE is `none`, `integer` or `float`: no MVE "
"adds `+nomve`, no scalar FP adds `+nofp`; integer-only MVE uses softfp while"
" FPU remains `none`. FP-MVE requires a declared available FPU. M55/M85 FPU "
"choices are `auto`, `fpv5-sp-d16` or `fpv5-d16`; `auto` is an explicit "
"compiler option, not hardware detection."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:46
msgid ""
"安全状态为 `single`、`secure` 或 `nonsecure`。只有支持安全扩展的 M23/M33/ M55/M85 "
"可声明后两者；Secure 编译添加 `-mcmse`。SAU 仅允许 Secure 事实为真。 Cache line 仅允许零或 32 "
"bytes，MPU 为零或该内核维护的 v7/v8 格式。M0/M0+/ M23 禁止 DWT "
"capability；其他内核也必须显式声明才能读已启用的周期计数器。"
msgstr ""
"Security state is `single`, `secure` or `nonsecure`. Only security-"
"extension-capable M23/M33/M55/M85 may declare the latter states; Secure adds"
" `-mcmse`. SAU requires true Secure facts. Cache lines are zero/32 bytes; "
"MPU is zero or maintained v7/v8 format. M0/M0+/M23 forbid DWT capability. "
"Other cores also require explicit facts to read an already enabled cycle "
"counter."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:51
msgid ""
"IRQ priority width、external IRQ count 和 clock 是芯片事实。PRIMASK profile 固定为 2 "
"个优先级 bits，BASEPRI profile 支持 3–8 bits。M0/M0+ 最多支持 32 个 external "
"IRQ，M3/M4/M7/M23 为 240，M33/M55/M85 为 480；SoC 必须 声明实际有效范围。这些边界不代替厂商芯片事实或电气验证。"
msgstr ""
"IRQ priority width, external IRQ count and clock are chip facts. PRIMASK "
"profiles fix two priority bits; BASEPRI supports 3–8. M0/M0+ support at most"
" 32 external IRQs; M3/M4/M7/M23 240; M33/M55/M85 480. SoCs declare actual "
"valid ranges. These limits do not replace vendor facts/electrical "
"verification."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:56
msgid "CPU 机制与所有权"
msgstr "CPU mechanisms and ownership"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:58
msgid ""
"Arch 无 SoC、I/O、内核或厂商 SDK 依赖。生产算法通过内联指令/MMIO 边界执行； GoogleTest/GoogleMock "
"只替换该硬件边界。Native 提供真实递归线程排他、C11 fence 与 publication 行为，不模拟 NVIC、物理 "
"IRQ、特权切换或真实周期。"
msgstr ""
"Arch depends on no SoC/I/O/kernel/vendor SDK. Production algorithms execute "
"through inline-instruction/MMIO boundaries; GoogleTest/GoogleMock replace "
"only that hardware boundary. Native provides actual recursive thread "
"exclusion, C11 fences/publication but models no NVIC, physical IRQ, "
"privilege switching or actual cycles."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:62
msgid ""
"PRIMASK token 只在同 CPU/线程逆序恢复一次，保留输入 BASEPRI/FAULTMASK。 被保护元数据只允许特权 "
"Thread/可配置 IRQ 参与，NMI/HardFault、其他核、安全 世界和 DMA 不在排他域内。上下文查询不授权 kernel ISR "
"调用；屏障不证明外设 idle 或 DMA drain。DWT 不启用/复位计数器，也不作为单调 deadline 时钟。"
msgstr ""
"Restore PRIMASK tokens once, in reverse order on the same CPU/thread, "
"preserving input BASEPRI/FAULTMASK. Protected metadata permits privileged "
"Thread/configurable IRQ only; NMI/HardFault, other CPUs/security worlds/DMA "
"are outside exclusion. Context queries authorize no kernel-ISR calls. "
"Barriers prove neither peripheral idle nor DMA drain. DWT enables/resets no "
"counters and is not a monotonic deadline source."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:67
msgid ""
"对齐 word acquire/release load/store 不屏蔽 IRQ。M0/M0+ RMW 使用 bounded saved-"
"PRIMASK exclusion，不静默链接 libatomic；其他核使用 compiler lock-free RMW，exclusive "
"retry 不等于固定 cycles。request/buffer/notify 生命周期仍由 owner 保证，atomic publication "
"不自动回收对象。"
msgstr ""
"Aligned-word acquire/release loads/stores do not mask IRQs. M0/M0+ RMW uses "
"bounded saved-PRIMASK exclusion without silent libatomic linkage. Other "
"cores use compiler lock-free RMW; exclusive retries are not fixed cycles. "
"Owners guarantee request/buffer/notification lifetimes; atomic publication "
"reclaims no objects."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:72
msgid ""
"`cache.h` 只维护独占的完整 32-byte lines，不 rounding、不 enable；所有相关 cache 在写入前完成 "
"capability/enabled 检查。DMA receive 前置/排空后的维护、 可达地址和 buffer loan 由 "
"provider/产品负责。`cache_control.h` 独立维护 M7 "
"冷启停，其他核明确拒绝。调用者提供自有控制对象并排除其他内存使用者；可信复位 或此前成功完成自有 clean/disable 是前提，CCR=0 "
"不能证明外来 dirty 状态干净。 实现校验实际 set/way 几何，失败保留 cache/selector 恢复责任；stack-free "
"leaf 完成全量 clean 后关闭 D-cache。它不属于运行中的普通范围维护或 DMA drain。"
msgstr ""
"`cache.h` maintains exclusive complete 32-byte lines only, without "
"rounding/enabling; all relevant cache capability/enabled checks precede "
"writes. Providers/products own pre-DMA-RX/post-drain maintenance, reachable "
"addresses and buffer loans. `cache_control.h` separately maintains M7 cold "
"enable/disable; other cores reject it. Callers supply owned control "
"objects/exclude other memory users. Trusted reset or prior successful owned "
"clean/disable is required; CCR=0 proves no foreign-dirty cleanliness. Actual"
" set/way geometry is checked, failures retain cache/selector responsibility,"
" and a stack-free leaf cleans all D-cache before disabling. This is neither "
"ordinary live range maintenance nor DMA drain."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:80
msgid ""
"MPU v7/v8 与 SAU 使用不同精确 encoder；实际单 region 编程要求本域内 privileged Thread、输入 "
"PRIMASK=1， 相应单元已经 disabled，保留 CTRL、其他 region 与输入 RNR，不隐式启用。"
msgstr ""
"MPU v7/v8 and SAU use distinct exact encoders. Actual single-region "
"programming requires privileged Thread in this domain, input PRIMASK=1 and "
"the unit already disabled. CTRL, other regions and input RNR are preserved; "
"nothing implicitly enables the unit."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:84
msgid ""
"产品拥有 MPU/MAIR policy、SAU/IDAU、NSC veneers、安全启动、共享资源协议和 恢复。单独的 CPU MPU "
"编程机制不建立用户任务隔离；显式 restricted-task runtime 使用实际 FreeRTOS MPU "
"port，软件与实板安全验收仍分别记录。"
msgstr ""
"Products own MPU/MAIR policy, SAU/IDAU, NSC veneers, secure boot, shared-"
"resource protocols and recovery. CPU MPU programming alone establishes no "
"user-task isolation. Explicit restricted-task runtime uses an actual "
"FreeRTOS MPU port; software and physical security acceptance remain "
"separate."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:88
msgid ""
"`nonsecure.h` 提供 Secure 特权 Thread 的完整跨度 CMSE 权限观察，按 NS 非特权 read/read-write "
"校验归属和 MPU；其他 image 明确拒绝。观察不复制或 pin 内存，不鉴别调用者、不排除 MMIO／DMA，也不冻结映射。具体集成必须补齐真实 "
"归属、调用者与存储稳定性证明；当前 F4 生产包不声明 TrustZone gateway。"
msgstr ""
"`nonsecure.h` provides full-span CMSE permission observations from "
"privileged Secure Thread, checking attribution and MPU for unprivileged NS "
"read/read-write. Other images reject explicitly. An observation does not "
"copy or pin memory, identify callers, exclude MMIO/DMA or freeze mappings. A"
" concrete integration must prove actual attribution, callers and storage "
"stability. Current production F4 packages declare no TrustZone gateway."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:93
msgid "FreeRTOS 软件合同"
msgstr "FreeRTOS software contracts"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:95
msgid ""
"全部 CPU profile 选择锁定内核的精确 port 源码；M0 及 v8-M port 同时编译所需 独立 assembly 文件。M7 无 "
"FP 使用从锁定 CM3 派生的受审构建 overlay，添加 errata 837070 的 PRIMASK-preserving BASEPRI "
"helpers 与 PendSV 处理，厂商 源文件保持锁定内容。禁止为了省事将所有内核映射到 CM4F。"
msgstr ""
"Every CPU profile selects exact pinned-kernel port sources; M0/v8-M also "
"compile required assembly files. Non-FP M7 uses a reviewed build overlay "
"derived from pinned CM3, adding erratum-837070 PRIMASK-preserving BASEPRI "
"helpers/PendSV handling while vendor files remain locked. Mapping every core"
" to CM4F for convenience is forbidden."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:100
msgid ""
"Armv8-M 的 NTZ、Secure-only 和 standalone NonSecure 默认路径由显式事实选择， 使用 "
"`configENABLE_TRUSTZONE=0`。可选 split profile 使用匹配的 Secure/NS 图像、 实际 TZ-aware "
"port 和调用者提供的 Secure context/Idle 存储，没有默认 Secure heap/pool。Secure 启动、IDAU/SAU"
" 与 NonSecure coprocessor access 仍由外部工程 负责。可选 MPU profile 提供 restricted task "
"与窄 delay/tick SVC；普通 API 保持 privileged 合同。MPU-only 与 split-only 独立，MPU+split"
" 当前拒绝。精确变体与 已执行软件证据见 [OS 支持](../contracts/os/execution.md)，不代表物理隔离验收。"
msgstr ""
"Armv8-M NTZ, Secure-only and standalone NonSecure defaults are selected by "
"explicit facts with `configENABLE_TRUSTZONE=0`. Optional split profiles use "
"matched Secure/NS images, actual TZ-aware ports and caller Secure-"
"context/Idle storage, without default Secure heaps/pools. External projects "
"still own Secure startup, IDAU/SAU and NS coprocessor access. Optional MPU "
"profiles provide restricted tasks/narrow delay-tick SVC; ordinary APIs "
"remain privileged. MPU-only/split-only are separate; MPU+split is rejected. "
"[OS support](../contracts/os/execution.md) records exact variants/executed "
"software evidence, not physical-isolation acceptance."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:108
msgid ""
"M55/M85 使用实际 MVE-aware context port。`configENABLE_FPU` 在 FP 或 MVE 存在时打开共享寄存器"
" bank 和 extended/lazy frame；integer-only MVE 不因此 获得 scalar FP "
"capability。Upper bank 的保存路径在 port 源码/对象中单独检查； VPR/lower bank 依赖硬件 extended "
"exception framing，是该 port 的验收假设， 必须结合架构资料与实板核对。编译/ELF 不能证明完整 payload 保留或真实 "
"FP/MVE 切换，不替代物理验收。"
msgstr ""
"M55/M85 use actual MVE-aware context ports. `configENABLE_FPU` with FP/MVE "
"enables shared register banks/extended-lazy frames; integer-only MVE gains "
"no scalar FP. Upper-bank save paths are checked separately in "
"source/objects. VPR/lower bank depend on hardware extended exception "
"framing, a port-acceptance assumption requiring architectural/physical "
"checks. Compilation/ELF proves neither complete payload retention nor real "
"FP/MVE switching and cannot replace physical acceptance."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:115
msgid ""
"任务、TCB、stack、queue 和 notification storage 由调用者静态提供，内核不链接 heap allocator。应用拥有"
" scheduler start、workers、队列深度、公平性、shutdown 进度与 join 后的 reclaim；平台启动不启动 "
"scheduler、不生成隐藏任务或 daemon。"
msgstr ""
"Callers statically supply tasks, TCBs, stacks, queues and notification "
"storage; kernels link no heap allocator. Applications own scheduler startup,"
" workers, queue depths, fairness, shutdown progress and post-join reclaim. "
"Platform start neither starts schedulers nor generates hidden tasks/daemons."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:119
msgid ""
"运行中 API 要求 privileged、unmasked Thread。仅在 NOT_STARTED 阶段接受锁定 port 的 canonical"
" bootstrap mask：Baseline 为 PRIMASK=1，Mainline 为精确 syscall BASEPRI；它们不能证明 "
"mask 的来源，不能在运行/暂停时继承许可。Fault mask 与其他 mask 在对象变更前拒绝。IRQ wake 另验证外部异常范围、优先级宽度"
" 与实际 port 的 syscall 合同，notification 只提示重查 request/sequence 谓词。"
msgstr ""
"Running APIs require privileged unmasked Thread. Only NOT_STARTED permits "
"the pinned port's canonical bootstrap mask: PRIMASK=1 for Baseline, exact "
"syscall BASEPRI for Mainline. Masks prove no provenance and confer no "
"runtime/suspended permission. Fault/other masks are rejected before object "
"changes. IRQ wake separately checks external exception range, priority width"
" and actual-port syscall rules; notification only prompts request/sequence "
"predicate rechecks."

#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/platforms/cortex-m.md:11
msgid ""
"Nexus 的 CPU 软件层支持 M0、M0+、M3、M4、M7、M23、M33、M55、M85。 同一不可变 CPU profile 解析器驱动 "
"Core、Arch、原子操作及裸机／FreeRTOS 运行时配置；DSP、FPU、MVE、cache、MPU、DWT、security 和 SAU "
"均显式声明。 选择内核不生成具体 SoC、Board、向量、启动、驱动、链接布局或 typed factory。 当前生产 SoC 包包含 "
"STM32F4 和 STM32F1，[精确器件与模式](support.md)分别审查。 实板 HIL 未执行。"
msgstr ""
"The Nexus CPU software layer supports M0, M0+, M3, M4, M7, M23, M33, M55, "
"and M85. The same immutable CPU profile resolver drives Core, Arch, atomics,"
" and bare-metal or FreeRTOS runtime configuration. DSP, FPU, MVE, cache, "
"MPU, DWT, security, and SAU are declared explicitly. A core selection alone "
"supplies no specific SoC, board, vectors, startup, driver, link layout, or "
"typed factory. The production SoC packages are STM32F4 and STM32F1. Review "
"their [exact parts and modes](support.md) individually. Physical HIL has not"
" been executed."
